    "detailed_description": "Super Retro World.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBased on a romance.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHelp the cute squirrel to rescue the pretty princess!!!<br />\r\nMany levels of pure mario-type platform action awake memories from the 1980s.<br />\r\nFunny creatures are trying to stop the squirrel from helping pretty princess. <br />\r\nThe squirrel is using spinning peanuts in order to defend itself.<br />\r\nHard to beat end-of-level Bosses  are there too, aiming to stop super squirrel from completing his mission.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy the game!!!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse the Arrow Keys or WASD to move (W or Up,S or Down,A or Left, D or Right) and Control (Ctrl) to throw peanuts.<br />\r\nTip: You can swap Green and Color game modes at any time, using the Options Menu",
    "about_the_game": "Super Retro World.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBased on a romance.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHelp the cute squirrel to rescue the pretty princess!!!<br />\r\nMany levels of pure mario-type platform action awake memories from the 1980s.<br />\r\nFunny creatures are trying to stop the squirrel from helping pretty princess. <br />\r\nThe squirrel is using spinning peanuts in order to defend itself.<br />\r\nHard to beat end-of-level Bosses  are there too, aiming to stop super squirrel from completing his mission.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy the game!!!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse the Arrow Keys or WASD to move (W or Up,S or Down,A or Left, D or Right) and Control (Ctrl) to throw peanuts.<br />\r\nTip: You can swap Green and Color game modes at any time, using the Options Menu",
    "short_description": "Super Retro World is a 2D platformer which is based on the idea of classic platform handheld console games like Super Mario Land.",
